"You can build the man pages and/or html docs, or use downloaded ones. If you"
" choose to build them, use the next two instructions."
msgstr ""
"Você pode construir as páginas de manual e(ou) documentos \"HTML\" ou usar "
"os baixados. Se você decidir construí-los(as), [então] use as próximas duas "
"instruções."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:180
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have installed <xref linkend=\"asciidoc\"/> you can create the html "
"version of the man pages and other docs:"
msgstr ""
"Se você instalou <xref linkend=\"asciidoc\"/>, [então] você pode criar a "
"versão \"HTML\" das páginas de manual e outros documentos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:184
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make html</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make html</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:187
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have installed <xref linkend=\"asciidoc\"/> and <xref "
"linkend=\"xmlto\"/> you can create the man pages:"
msgstr ""
"Se você instalou <xref linkend=\"asciidoc\"/> e <xref linkend=\"xmlto\"/>, "
"[então] você pode criar as páginas de manual:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:191
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make man</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make man</userinput>"

#. https://lore.kernel.org/git/4e2952e512afc780b621d2c153b3e6e4eb7ed89a.camel@xry111.site/
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/git.xml:194
#, fuzzy, xml-text
#| msgid ""
#| "The test suite can be run in parallel mode. To run the test suite, issue: "
#| "<command>GIT_UNZIP=nonexist make test -k |&amp; tee test.log</command>.  The"
#| " <envar>GIT_UNZIP</envar> setting prevents the test suite from using "
#| "<command>unzip</command>, we need it because in BLFS "
#| "<command>unzip</command> is a symlink to <command>bsdunzip</command> which "
#| "does not satisfy the assumption of some tests cases.  If any test case "
#| "fails, the list of failed tests can be shown via <command>grep '^not ok' "
#| "test.log | grep -v TODO</command>."
msgid ""
"The test suite can be run in parallel mode. To run the test suite, issue: "
"<command>GIT_UNZIP=nonexist make test -k</command>.  The "
"<envar>GIT_UNZIP</envar> setting prevents the test suite from using "
"<command>unzip</command>, we need it because in BLFS "
"<command>unzip</command> is a symlink to <command>bsdunzip</command> which "
"does not satisfy the assumption of some tests cases.  If any test case "
"fails, the list of failed tests can be shown via <command>make -C t "
"aggregate-results</command>.  One test, <literal>t7528</literal>, is known "
"to fail with OpenSSH 10.1 or newer."
msgstr ""
"A suíte de teste pode ser executada em modo paralelo. Para executar a suíte "
"de teste, emita: <command>GIT_UNZIP=nonexist make test -k |&amp; tee "
"test.log</command>. A configuração <envar>GIT_UNZIP</envar> impede que a "
"suíte de teste use <command>unzip</command>; nós precisamos dela porque no "
"BLFS <command>unzip</command> é um link simbólico para "
"<command>bsdunzip</command> que não satisfaz a suposição de alguns casos de "
"teste. Se algum caso de teste falhar, a lista de testes falhos pode ser "
"mostrada via <command>grep '^not ok' test.log | grep -v TODO</command>."

